  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="25">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIAs">II As</ref> 25</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif minra gerefena hwylc þonne þis don nylle ⁊ læs ymbe beo þonne we gecwæden habbað, þonne gylde he mine oferhyrnesse ⁊ ic finde oþerne ðe wile.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If any of my reeves is not willing to carry out this [our ordinance], or shows less regard for it than we have declared [he must], then he shall pay the fine due to me for insubordination, and I will find another [reeve] who will be willing.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif minra gerefena gehwylce ðis dón nylle oþþe læsse ymb sy þonne we gecwæden habbaþ, gylde min oferhyrnesse ; ⁊ ic finde oþerne ðe wille.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
